2025-09-14 06:10:20 [grok-code-fast-1] - `author`: User object of the sender.
2025-09-14 06:10:20 [grok-code-fast-1] - `guild`: Guild object (server) where sent (null if DM).
2025-09-14 06:10:20 [grok-code-fast-1] - `channel`: Channel object (text, voice, etc.).
2025-09-14 06:10:20 [grok-code-fast-1] - `createdAt`: Date when created.
2025-09-14 06:10:20 [grok-code-fast-1] - `editedAt`: Date when last edited (null if not).
2025-09-14 06:10:20 [grok-code-fast-1] - `attachments`: Array of attachment objects.
2025-09-14 06:10:20 [grok-code-fast-1] - `embeds`: Array of embed objects.
2025-09-14 06:10:20 [grok-code-fast-1] - `reactions`: ReactionManager for managing reactions.
2025-09-14 06:10:20 [grok-code-fast-1] - `replies`: Method to reply to the message.
2025-09-14 06:10:20 [grok-code-fast-1] - `react`: Method to add an emoji reaction.
