2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] Short answer: the bot needs VIEWCHANNEL and SENDMESSAGES plus ATTACHFILES to upload
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] image files. EMBEDLINKS is needed if you send images via embeds (image URL in an embed). A few
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] optional extras and notes below.
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] 
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] Minimum permissions to post an image in a guild channel
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] - VIEW_CHANNEL (so the bot can see the channel)
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] - SEND_MESSAGES (so it can send messages there)
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] - ATTACH_FILES (required to upload image files as attachments)
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] 
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] If you use embeds or image URLs
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] - EMBED_LINKS (required to show embed content when you include an image URL in an embed)
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] 
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] Useful/optional permissions
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] - READMESSAGEHISTORY (if the bot inspects prior messages)
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] - MANAGE_MESSAGES (only if the bot must delete or pin messages)
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] - MANAGE_WEBHOOKS (only if you plan to create/manage webhooks)
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] 
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] OAuth scopes to add the bot to a server
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] - bot (required)
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] - applications.commands (if you expose slash commands)
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] 
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] Intents (for receiving events)
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] - GUILD_MESSAGES (to receive message events in guilds)
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] - MESSAGE_CONTENT (only if you need to read message text without slash commands; request this
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] sparingly)
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] 
