2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] - File size limits: Discord imposes per-file limits (default ~8 MB for unboosted servers / standard
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] bot accounts; larger limits with server boosts or Nitro). Consider hosting large files externally
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] and sending a URL/embed.
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] - Rate limits: respect Discord API rate limits for attachments and embeds.
2025-09-16 09:14:37 [gpt-5-mini] - Webhooks: posting via webhooks can bypass a bot user for posting; creating webhooks requires
