2025-09-16 12:51:59 [gpt-5-mini] NDJSON (newline-delimited JSON) = one JSON value per line (usually JSON objects),
2025-09-16 12:51:59 [gpt-5-mini] newline-separated, no surrounding array or commas. Common for logs, streaming, and bulk import.
