2025-09-16 12:51:59 [gpt-5-mini] Quick rules:
2025-09-16 12:51:59 [gpt-5-mini] - Each line must be valid JSON (objects, arrays, strings, numbers, etc.).
2025-09-16 12:51:59 [gpt-5-mini] - Lines are independent; parsers read and parse line-by-line.
2025-09-16 12:51:59 [gpt-5-mini] - Final newline is optional but common.
