2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] 1.  Cut-off fence
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] Pick a hard date (e.g. 1923-12-31 for public-domain pre-modern).
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] Never let a single token whose primary publication date is > fence into the “history” corpus.
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] Use a two-repo layout on disk:
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] clean-room/
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905]  ├─ 00-corpus/          # historical only
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905]  ├─ 01-metadata/        # TSV:  id  date  title  url
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905]  ├─ 02-scripts/         # this file + checksum utils
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905]  ├─ 03-checksums.sha256 # blinded file hashes
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905]  └─ 04-report.md        # signed, dated report
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] 2.  Ingest pipeline (one-command)
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] `deno task ingest --before 1924 --provenance-json`
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] a.  Spider or copy source files into `staging/`.
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] b.  Run `csi-detect` (see below) → drop anything with “© 19XX–202Y” etc.
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] c.  Sha256 every surviving file → `03-checksums.sha256`.
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] d.  Move survivors → `00-corpus/`.
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] e.  Write nightly manifest:  `id <tab> bytes <tab> first512sha256`.
