2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] 8.  What you gain
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] -  Zero legal leakage of modern text into the historical slice.
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] -  KL-penalty keeps the model from “drifting” toward modern style.
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] -  Checksum + manifest gives you verifiable lineage—useful if you ever publish the weights
2025-09-16 13:09:27 [kimi-k2-0905] or a paper.
