2025-09-18 09:35:55 [qwen-plus-2025] Group. My specifications include:
2025-09-18 09:35:55 [qwen-plus-2025] 
2025-09-18 09:35:55 [qwen-plus-2025] - Model Size: Ranging from billions to trillions of parameters, supporting various scales
2025-09-18 09:35:55 [qwen-plus-2025] such as Qwen-Max, Qwen-Plus, Qwen-Turbo, and Qwen-Long.
2025-09-18 09:35:55 [qwen-plus-2025] - Multilingual Support: Strong proficiency in over 100 languages, including Chinese,
2025-09-18 09:35:55 [qwen-plus-2025] English, French, Spanish, Portuguese, Russian, Arabic, Japanese, Korean, Vietnamese, Thai,
2025-09-18 09:35:55 [qwen-plus-2025] Indonesian, etc.
2025-09-18 09:35:55 [qwen-plus-2025] - Reasoning & Coding: Excellent logical reasoning, mathematical calculation, and code
2025-09-18 09:35:55 [qwen-plus-2025] generation capabilities, supporting multiple programming languages like Python, Java, C++,
2025-09-18 09:35:55 [qwen-plus-2025] JavaScript, etc.
2025-09-18 09:35:55 [qwen-plus-2025] - Context Length: Supports long-context input (up to 32K tokens or more), suitable for
2025-09-18 09:35:55 [qwen-plus-2025] processing lengthy documents and complex tasks.
2025-09-18 09:35:55 [qwen-plus-2025] - Dialogue Understanding: Optimized for multi-turn conversations with enhanced memory and
2025-09-18 09:35:55 [qwen-plus-2025] contextual understanding.
2025-09-18 09:35:55 [qwen-plus-2025] - Deployment Flexibility: Available via API, open-source versions on Hugging Face, and
2025-09-18 09:35:55 [qwen-plus-2025] customizable deployment options for enterprise use.
