2025-09-25 07:48:11 [nitro@ryzen5] Summarise the standard markdown formatting rules
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025] Here’s a concise overview of common Markdown syntax:
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025] 
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025] • Headings
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025]   Prefix with 1–6 hash signs:
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025]     # H1
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025]     ## H2 … ###### H6
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025] 
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025] • Emphasis
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025]   Italic or italic
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025]   Bold or bold
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025]   ~~Strikethrough~~
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025] 
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025] • Lists
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025]   • Unordered: use `-`, `*` or `+`
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025]   • Ordered: `1.`, `2.`, …
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025] 
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025] • Links & Images
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025]   • Link: `[text](URL “title”)`
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025]   • Image: `![alt text](URL “title”)`
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025] 
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025] • Code
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025]   • Inline: `` `code` ``
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025]   • Block:
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025] 
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025]     // code block
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025] 
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025] 
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025] • Blockquotes
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025]   Prefix lines with `>`
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025]     > Quote text
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025] 
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025] • Horizontal Rule
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025]   `---`, `*`, or `_` on a line by itself
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025] 
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025] • Tables
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025] 
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025]   | Col 1 | Col 2 |
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025]   | ----- | ----- |
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025]   | Val 1 | Val 2 |
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025] 
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025] 
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025] • Escaping
2025-09-25 07:48:17 [o4-mini-2025]   Prefix special characters with backslash `\` if you want them literal.
