2025-09-26 17:52:00 [nitro@ryzen5] install deno on aws ecs
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025] Here’s a high-level recipe for running a Deno service on AWS ECS (Fargate):
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025] 
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025] 1. Dockerize your Deno app
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]    • Create a `Dockerfile` in your project root:
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025] 
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      FROM denoland/deno:alpine-1.44.4
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      WORKDIR /app
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      USER deno
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      COPY deps.ts .
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      RUN deno cache deps.ts
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      COPY . .
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      CMD ["run", "--allow-net", "mod.ts"]
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025] 
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025] 2. Push image to ECR
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]    • Create an ECR repo:
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025] 
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      aws ecr create-repository --repository-name my-deno-app
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025] 
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]    • Authenticate & push:
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025] 
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      aws ecr get-login-password --region us-east-1 \
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]        | docker login --username AWS --password-stdin 123456789012.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      docker build -t my-deno-app .
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      docker tag my-deno-app:latest 123456789012.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/my-deno-app:latest
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      docker push 123456789012.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/my-deno-app:latest
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025] 
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025] 3. Define an ECS Task
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]    Create `task-definition.json` (tabs for indentation):
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025] 
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      {
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      	"family": "deno-task",
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      	"networkMode": "awsvpc",
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      	"requiresCompatibilities": ["FARGATE"],
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      	"cpu": "256",
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      	"memory": "512",
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      	"executionRoleArn": "arn:aws:iam::123456789012:role/ecsTaskExecutionRole",
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      	"containerDefinitions": [
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      		{
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      			"name": "deno",
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      			"image": "123456789012.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/my-deno-app:latest",
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      			"portMappings": [{ "containerPort": 80, "protocol": "tcp" }],
2025-09-26 17:52:10 [o4-mini-2025]      			"essential": true
