2025-09-28 10:12:17 [nitro@ryzen5] git checkout kids recursively
2025-09-28 10:12:27 [o4-mini-2025] Run these in your repo root:
2025-09-28 10:12:27 [o4-mini-2025] 
2025-09-28 10:12:27 [o4-mini-2025] 	git checkout kids
2025-09-28 10:12:27 [o4-mini-2025] 	git submodule update --init --recursive
2025-09-28 10:12:27 [o4-mini-2025] 	git submodule foreach --recursive "git fetch && git checkout kids"
2025-09-28 10:12:27 [o4-mini-2025] 
2025-09-28 10:12:27 [o4-mini-2025] If submodules don’t yet have a local kids branch, use:
2025-09-28 10:12:27 [o4-mini-2025] 
2025-09-28 10:12:27 [o4-mini-2025] 	git submodule foreach --recursive "git fetch origin kids && git checkout -B kids origin/kids"
