2025-09-29 10:45:08 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-09-29 10:45:08 [deepseek-chat] • Notes:*
2025-09-29 10:45:08 [deepseek-chat] - Can be done on running instances (no downtime)
2025-09-29 10:45:08 [deepseek-chat] - Must expand filesystem in OS afterward
2025-09-29 10:45:08 [deepseek-chat] - Linux: Use `growpart` and `resize2fs`/`xfs_growfs`
2025-09-29 10:45:08 [deepseek-chat] - Price increases proportionally to new size
