2025-09-29 11:47:35 [deepseek-chat] The speed comes from:
2025-09-29 11:47:35 [deepseek-chat] - `-j8` running 8 parallel compilation jobs
2025-09-29 11:47:35 [deepseek-chat] - Cached object files from previous builds (incremental rebuild)
2025-09-29 11:47:35 [deepseek-chat] - Only recompiling what's actually changed
2025-09-29 11:47:35 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-09-29 11:47:35 [deepseek-chat] To do a full clean rebuild:
2025-09-29 11:47:35 [deepseek-chat] 
