2025-09-30 09:50:57 [nitro@ryzen5] scp is horribly slow, faster option for ec2 target
2025-09-30 09:51:05 [deepseek-chat] For faster file transfer to EC2:
2025-09-30 09:51:05 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-09-30 09:51:05 [deepseek-chat] • AWS CLI S3 Sync* (recommended):
2025-09-30 09:51:05 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-09-30 09:51:05 [deepseek-chat] aws s3 sync /local/directory s3://your-bucket/target/
