2025-10-09 17:53:04 [gemini-2.5-flash]         }
2025-10-09 17:53:04 [gemini-2.5-flash]         e = nextEvent; // Process next event immediately if no delay
2025-10-09 17:53:04 [gemini-2.5-flash]     }
