2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5] 3. Unbounded `outputBuffer` growth
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5]    - No size limits; long sessions accumulate memory
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5] High Priority
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5] 4. Error handling in `relay()`
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5]    - Catches generic `error.error.error` pattern - fragile across providers
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5]    - Should validate response shape before access
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5] 5. Tool recursion depth unchecked
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5]    - `relay(depth+1)` has no max depth guard; infinite loops possible with misconfigured tools
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5] 6. File API caching inconsistency
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5]    - `anthropicStore` uses filename hash but `anthropicFile()` may re-upload identical content if
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5] hash mismatches
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5] Medium Priority
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5] 7. Configuration persistence
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5]    - `roha.config` can be undefined at startup; should validate against `emptyConfig` schema
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5] 8. Model spec lookups
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5]    - Repeated `modelname in modelSpecs` checks; consider caching in `roha.mut[modelname]`
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5] 9. Temperature validation
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5]    - Accepts `-5` to `50`; most models expect `0.0-2.0`. Clamp per-provider limits
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5] 10. Deno.run() deprecated
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5]     - Replace with `Deno.Command` throughout (already mixed in code)
2025-10-19 09:33:11 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
