2025-10-21 09:09:19 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Unbounded growth* - exceeding any finite limit
2025-10-21 09:09:19 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2025-10-21 09:09:19 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Asymptotic behavior* - approaching infinity
2025-10-21 09:09:19 [claude-haiku-4-5] 
2025-10-21 09:09:19 [claude-haiku-4-5] • Singularity* - a point where a function becomes undefined or infinite
