2025-10-21 13:57:50 [qwen3-coder-plus] size exceeds their 4 MB limit.
2025-10-21 13:57:50 [qwen3-coder-plus] 
2025-10-21 13:57:50 [qwen3-coder-plus] Fountain can’t override that limit—it only manages the request before sending it.
2025-10-21 13:57:50 [qwen3-coder-plus] 
2025-10-21 13:57:50 [qwen3-coder-plus] Your options are:
2025-10-21 13:57:50 [qwen3-coder-plus] 
