2025-10-21 13:57:50 [qwen3-coder-plus] 2. Use `/drop` to remove attached files
2025-10-21 13:57:50 [qwen3-coder-plus] 3. Use `/reset` to clear history if the conversation got too long
2025-10-21 13:57:50 [qwen3-coder-plus] 4. Share smaller files or split large ones before attaching
2025-10-21 13:57:50 [qwen3-coder-plus] 
2025-10-21 13:57:50 [qwen3-coder-plus] Kimi’s limit is 4 MB regardless of what Fountain sends.
