2025-10-21 14:00:49 [claude-sonnet-4] 4. Updates the conversation history with the new model context
2025-10-21 14:00:49 [claude-sonnet-4] 
2025-10-21 14:00:49 [claude-sonnet-4] The system tracks active models separately from all available models, so it will skip
2025-10-21 14:00:49 [claude-sonnet-4] inactive/deprecated models when cycling. This is useful for testing across your preferred model set
2025-10-21 14:00:49 [claude-sonnet-4] without manually specifying each one.
2025-10-21 14:00:49 [claude-sonnet-4] 
2025-10-21 14:00:49 [claude-sonnet-4] The model switching preserves your conversation history and shared files, just changes which LLM
2025-10-21 14:00:49 [claude-sonnet-4] processes new messages.
