2025-10-21 15:00:44 [kimi-k2-0905] when needed, all while maintaining conversation continuity.
2025-10-21 15:00:44 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-21 15:00:44 [kimi-k2-0905] The balance between model capabilities and costs becomes much more manageable with this kind of
2025-10-21 15:00:44 [kimi-k2-0905] intelligent fallback system.
