2025-10-22 13:03:00 [nitro@ryzen5] ㊀
2025-10-22 13:03:04 [qwen3-coder-plus] The character ㊀ is a Unicode character from the Enclosed CJK Letters and Months block. It
2025-10-22 13:03:04 [qwen3-coder-plus] represents the number "1" in a circular enclosure, specifically the circled number one.
2025-10-22 13:03:04 [qwen3-coder-plus] 
2025-10-22 13:03:04 [qwen3-coder-plus] Unicode: U+3280 (in the Enclosed CJK Letters and Months block)
2025-10-22 13:03:04 [qwen3-coder-plus] 
2025-10-22 13:03:04 [qwen3-coder-plus] It's commonly used in Japanese and other East Asian contexts as a decorative or emphasized way to
2025-10-22 13:03:04 [qwen3-coder-plus] write the number 1.
2025-10-22 13:03:04 [qwen3-coder-plus] 
