2025-10-24 08:21:10 [qwen3-coder-plus] This is a TypeScript file implementing a raw mode prompt replacement for what appears to be a "slop
2025-10-24 08:21:10 [qwen3-coder-plus] fountain" system. The code handles:
2025-10-24 08:21:10 [qwen3-coder-plus] 
2025-10-24 08:21:10 [qwen3-coder-plus] • Key Features:*
2025-10-24 08:21:10 [qwen3-coder-plus] - TCP connection management (port 8081) for inter-process communication
2025-10-24 08:21:10 [qwen3-coder-plus] - Raw stdin/stdout handling with escape sequence processing
2025-10-24 08:21:10 [qwen3-coder-plus] - Emoji shortcode replacement (e.g., `:heart:` → ❤️)
2025-10-24 08:21:10 [qwen3-coder-plus] - Command history with up/down arrow navigation
2025-10-24 08:21:10 [qwen3-coder-plus] - UTF-8 multi-byte sequence handling
2025-10-24 08:21:10 [qwen3-coder-plus] - Grapheme cluster segmentation for proper character width calculation
2025-10-24 08:21:10 [qwen3-coder-plus] 
2025-10-24 08:21:10 [qwen3-coder-plus] • Notable Functions:*
2025-10-24 08:21:10 [qwen3-coder-plus] - `slopPrompt()` - Main input loop with background task refresh
2025-10-24 08:21:10 [qwen3-coder-plus] - `slopBroadcast()` - Send messages to connected clients
2025-10-24 08:21:10 [qwen3-coder-plus] - `stringWidth()` - Calculate display width accounting for wide Unicode characters
2025-10-24 08:21:10 [qwen3-coder-plus] - `listenService()` - Handle incoming TCP connections
2025-10-24 08:21:10 [qwen3-coder-plus] - `addInput()` - Process text with proper grapheme segmentation
2025-10-24 08:21:10 [qwen3-coder-plus] 
2025-10-24 08:21:10 [qwen3-coder-plus] • Technical Details:*
2025-10-24 08:21:10 [qwen3-coder-plus] - Uses Deno APIs for TCP networking and stdin raw mode
2025-10-24 08:21:10 [qwen3-coder-plus] - Implements custom terminal escape sequence handling
2025-10-24 08:21:10 [qwen3-coder-plus] - Handles emoji and wide character display correctly
2025-10-24 08:21:10 [qwen3-coder-plus] - Includes memory management considerations for long-running processes
2025-10-24 08:21:10 [qwen3-coder-plus] 
