2025-10-24 08:39:42 [qwen3-coder-plus] fails. The problem is that when `decoder.decode()` succeeds but produces an invalid character, the
2025-10-24 08:39:42 [qwen3-coder-plus] function continues without checking if the decoded text is actually valid Unicode.
2025-10-24 08:39:42 [qwen3-coder-plus] 
2025-10-24 08:39:42 [qwen3-coder-plus] Add validation after decoding:
2025-10-24 08:39:42 [qwen3-coder-plus] 
