2025-10-27 10:14:00 [kimi-k2-0905] Watch the hammers while you stomp: if none of them budge yet you still hear the chord, you’ll know
2025-10-27 10:14:00 [kimi-k2-0905] the soundboard and undamped strings are doing the work, not the action.
