2025-10-27 10:28:02 [kimi-k2-0905] How hard you stomp → how far the rail jumps → how fast the hammers leave it → how loud the cluster
2025-10-27 10:28:02 [kimi-k2-0905] speaks.
2025-10-27 10:28:02 [kimi-k2-0905] You’ve turned the soft-pedal lever into an analog drum-pad for the entire piano.
2025-10-27 10:28:02 [kimi-k2-0905] 
