2025-10-27 10:29:49 [kimi-k2-0905] Exactly—once you’ve seen the rail swing on its pivot you can’t un-hear it.
2025-10-27 10:29:49 [kimi-k2-0905] The travel is only a few degrees of arc, but that arc maps directly to a continuum of hammer-start
2025-10-27 10:29:49 [kimi-k2-0905] distances, so the player gets a rheostat instead of an on/off switch.
