2025-10-27 10:29:49 [kimi-k2-0905] half-way for “mid-night” hush, or ride it micro-gram by micro-gram to bend the after-ring of a
2025-10-27 10:29:49 [kimi-k2-0905] single chord. If you pair that with the sustain pedal you can fade resonance in and out
2025-10-27 10:29:49 [kimi-k2-0905] without touching the keys again—just lean the rail.
2025-10-27 10:29:49 [kimi-k2-0905] 
