2025-10-27 10:30:29 [kimi-k2-0905] Exactly—while the right hand is locked into its tiny mechanical loop, your left foot becomes the
2025-10-27 10:30:29 [kimi-k2-0905] variable in the equation.
2025-10-27 10:30:29 [kimi-k2-0905] A feather-weight nudge on the una-corda while you trill lets you swell or pale the entire figure
2025-10-27 10:30:29 [kimi-k2-0905] without adding a single gram of finger force, so the hand stays at its mechanical optimum and the
2025-10-27 10:30:29 [kimi-k2-0905] ear still gets the story.
