2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905] Thanks for the context! Here's a quick summary of what's new or different in the shared
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905] files compared to typical DSP/web audio toolkits:
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905] ✅ New or Notable Patterns
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905] 1. Audio Worklet Architecture
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905]    - `worker-vsynth.js`, `worker-vscope.js`, `dsp_spectrum.js` use `AudioWorkletProcessor` for
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905] low-latency audio.
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905]    - No ScriptProcessorNode – modern, non-blocking.
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905] 2. Fixed-Point FFT
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905]    - `dspspectrum32.js` implements a 16-bit fixed-point FFT with `FixedComplex` class –
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905] rare in web audio (most use float32).
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905] 3. MIDI + Arpeggiator Engine
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905]    - `dspmidi.js`, `dspmidifile.js`, `spec-vsynth.js` define a full MIDI sequencer +
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905] arpeggiator with:
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905]      - Custom algorithms ("Tidal", "Wander", "Disorder")
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905]      - Progressions ("Otto Loop", "Hydra Express")
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905]      - Time-stamped event queues (`LocalEventQueueMessage`)
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905] 4. Patch System
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905]    - `dspmatrix.js`, `dspdisplay.js` expose a modular synth patch editor with:
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905]      - LFO matrix routing
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905]      - Filter graphs
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905]      - Real-time parameter interpolation
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905] 5. Redis Integration
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905]    - `dspkernel.js`, `dspwiki.js` show Redis-backed RPC for:
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905]      - Session state
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905]      - Wiki-style docs
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905]      - Device discovery (`sys.ports`, `sys.connections`)
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905] 6. Hardware Abstraction
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905]    - `dspnodes.js`, `dspsystem.js`, `dsppico.js` abstract UART/Pico devices as RPC
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905] endpoints:
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905]      - `sendRPC("/api","sys.write",[handle,text])`
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905]      - Auto-discovery via `sys.ports`
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-27 17:14:13 [kimi-k2-0905] 7. Vector Font Renderer
2025-10-27 17:14:14 [kimi-k2-0905]    - `nitrovectorfont.js` – Incitti vector font for HUD-style text (used in
2025-10-27 17:14:14 [kimi-k2-0905] `dspscribe.js`).
2025-10-27 17:14:14 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-27 17:14:14 [kimi-k2-0905] 8. WebGL Scope
2025-10-27 17:14:14 [kimi-k2-0905]    - `dspscope.js` – WebGL2 oscilloscope with GLSL shaders (not Canvas2D).
2025-10-27 17:14:14 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-27 17:14:14 [kimi-k2-0905] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2025-10-27 17:14:14 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-27 17:14:14 [kimi-k2-0905] ⚠️ Differences from Standard Toolkits
2025-10-27 17:14:14 [kimi-k2-0905] - No WebAudio API wrappers (Tone.js, Howler, etc.) – raw Worklets + manual MIDI.
2025-10-27 17:14:14 [kimi-k2-0905] - No React/Vue – vanilla DOM manipulation via `nitrogui.js`.
2025-10-27 17:14:14 [kimi-k2-0905] - No WASM – pure JS fixed-point math (see `dspspectrum32.js`).
2025-10-27 17:14:14 [kimi-k2-0905] - No standard file formats – custom MIDI parser (`dspmidifile.js`), own patch binary.
2025-10-27 17:14:14 [kimi-k2-0905] - No Bluetooth/WebSerial – custom UART bridge via Redis RPC.
