2025-10-29 09:24:28 [kimi-k2-0905] Quick optional hardening:
2025-10-29 09:24:28 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-29 09:24:28 [kimi-k2-0905] 1. Drop the pause to 2 s and return 444 (nginx-style “no response”) instead of 429—saves bandwidth.
2025-10-29 09:24:28 [kimi-k2-0905] 2. Add a one-line fail-2-ban rule if you see the same IP hitting multiple fake paths in a minute.
2025-10-29 09:24:28 [kimi-k2-0905] 3. Return `Content-Length: 0` and close the socket immediately; some scanners give up faster.
2025-10-29 09:24:28 [kimi-k2-0905] 
