2025-10-29 15:25:32 [gpt-5-mini] collapsed by the terminal/font (emoji are rendered as full‑width glyphs and can interact with
2025-10-29 15:25:32 [gpt-5-mini] adjacent spacing or variation selectors), so it looks like there's no gap.
