2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] Here's an initial grouping, starting with "Basic System Discovery" as requested, and a few other
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] common categories.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] 
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • 1. Basic System Discovery / Information:*
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `lscpu`: Display information about the CPU architecture.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `uname`: Print system information.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `hostname`: Show or set the system's host name.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `hostnamectl`: Control the system hostname.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `dmesg`: Print or control the kernel ring buffer.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `uptime`: Tell how long the system has been running.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `free`: Display amount of free and used memory in the system.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `df`: Report file system disk space usage.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `du`: Estimate file space usage.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `lsblk`: List block devices.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `fdisk`: Manipulate disk partition table.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `mount`: Mount a filesystem.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `who`: Print all usernames currently logged in.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `whoami`: Print effective user ID.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `w`: Show who is logged on and what they are doing.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `last`: Show a listing of last logged in users.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `lastlog`: Reports the most recent login of all users.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `ip`: Show/manipulate routing, devices, policy routing and tunnels.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `netstat`: Print network connections, routing tables, interface statistics, etc.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `ss`: Another utility to investigate sockets.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `ps`: Report a snapshot of the current processes.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `top`: Display Linux processes.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `mpstat`: Report processors related statistics.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `iostat`: Report CPU utilization and I/O statistics.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `vmstat`: Report virtual memory statistics.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `sar`: Collect, report, or save system activity information.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `stat`: Display file or file system status.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `file`: Determine file type.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `getent`: Get entries from Name Service Switch libraries.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `getconf`: Get configuration values.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `locale`: Get/set locale information.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `localectl`: Control the system locale and keyboard layout.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `timedatectl`: Control the system time and date.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `systemd-analyze`: Analyze system boot-up performance.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `journalctl`: Query the systemd journal.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `sestatus`: Display SELinux status.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `id`: Print real and effective user and group IDs.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `groups`: Print the names of the primary and any supplementary groups for each user name.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `logname`: Print user's login name.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `pinky`: Lightweight finger.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `users`: Print the user names of users currently logged in to the current host.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `readlink`: Print value of a symbolic link or canonical file name.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `realpath`: Print the resolved path of a file.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `which`: Show the full path of (shell) commands.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `whereis`: Locate the binary, source, and manual page files for a command.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `whatis`: Display one-line manual page descriptions.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `apropos`: Search the manual page names and descriptions.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `man`: An interface to the system reference manuals.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `info`: Read info documents.
2025-10-30 09:18:02 [gemini-2.5-05] • `type`: Display information about command type.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `env`: Run a program in a modified environment.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `printenv`: Print all or part of environment.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `cloud-id`: Get cloud instance ID.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `cloud-init`: Cloud initialization.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `cloud-init-per`: Run a command once per instance for cloud-init.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `needs-restarting`: Check which daemons need to be restarted.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `systemd-detect-virt`: Detect whether system is running in a virtualized environment.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `slabtop`: Display kernel slab cache information.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `lsmem`: List currently available memory.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `lsipc`: Show information on IPC facilities.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `ipcs`: Provide information on IPC facilities.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `lslocks`: List local system locks.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `lsns`: List namespaces.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `cpupower`: Show and set CPU power related info.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `turbostat`: Report CPU frequency and idle statistics.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `powernow-k8-decode`: Decode PowerNow! K8 data.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `utmpdump`: Dump UTMP and WTMP files.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] 
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • 2. File & Directory Management:*
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `ls`: List directory contents.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `cp`: Copy files and directories.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `mv`: Move or rename files.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `rm`: Remove files or directories.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `rmdir`: Remove empty directories.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `mkdir`: Make directories.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `mkfifo`: Make FIFOs (named pipes).
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `mknod`: Make block or character special files.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `ln`: Make links between files.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `link`: Call link function to create a link to a file.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `unlink`: Call unlink function to delete a file.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `install`: Copy files and set attributes.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `find`: Search for files in a directory hierarchy.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `touch`: Change file timestamps.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `basename`: Strip directory and suffix from filenames.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `dirname`: Strip non-directory suffix from filename.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `pathchk`: Check portability of file names.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `shred`: Overwrite a file to hide its contents, and optionally delete it.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `hardlink`: Consolidate duplicate files.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] 
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • 3. Text Processing & Manipulation:*
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `cat`: Concatenate files and print on the standard output.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `tac`: Concatenate and print files in reverse.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `nl`: Number lines of files.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `head`: Output the first part of files.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `tail`: Output the last part of files.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `more`: File perusal filter for crt viewing.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `less`: Pager program.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `pr`: Convert text files for printing.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `fmt`: Simple optimal text formatter.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `fold`: Wrap each input line to fit in specified width.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `paste`: Merge lines of files.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `join`: Join lines of two files on a common field.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `comm`: Compare two sorted files line by line.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `split`: Split a file into pieces.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `expand`: Convert tabs to spaces.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `unexpand`: Convert spaces to tabs.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `tr`: Translate or delete characters.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `sed`: Stream editor.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `awk`: Pattern scanning and processing language.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `grep`: Print lines matching a pattern.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `fgrep`: Print lines matching a fixed string pattern.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `egrep`: Print lines matching an extended regular expression pattern.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `bzgrep`, `bzegrep`, `bzfgrep`: Grep for compressed bzip2 files.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `zgrep`, `zegrep`, `zfgrep`: Grep for compressed gzip files.
2025-10-30 09:18:03 [gemini-2.5-05] • `xzgrep`, `xzegrep`, `xzfgrep`: Grep for compressed xz files.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `cut`: Remove sections from each line of files.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `sort`: Sort lines of text files.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `uniq`: Report or omit repeated lines.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `wc`: Print newline, word, and byte counts for each file.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `diff`, `diff3`, `diffstat`, `interdiff`, `gendiff`, `rediff`, `filterdiff`, `unwraprdiff`,
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] `gitdiff`, `vimdiff`: File comparison utilities.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `patch`: Apply a diff file to an original.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `xargs`: Build and execute command lines from standard input.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `tee`: Read from standard input and write to standard output and files.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `printf`: Format and print data.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `echo`: Display a line of text.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `strings`: Print the strings of printable characters in files.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `hexdump`: Filter which displays the specified files, or standard input, in a user-specified
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] format.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `xxd`: Make a hex dump or revert it.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `rev`: Reverse lines of a file.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `col`, `colcrt`, `colrm`, `column`: Text formatting utilities.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] 
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • 4. Networking Tools:*
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `ping`: Send ICMP ECHO_REQUEST to network hosts.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `arp`: Manipulate the system ARP cache.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `arping`: Send ARP requests to a host.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `dig`: DNS lookup utility.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `nslookup`: Query Internet name servers.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `host`: Perform DNS lookups.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `traceroute`: Print the route packets take to network host.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `traceroute6`: IPv6 traceroute.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `tracepath`, `tracepath6`: Trace path to network host.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `tcptraceroute`: Traceroute using TCP packets.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `ssh`: OpenSSH client (remote login program).
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `ssh-add`: Adds RSA or DSA identities to the authentication agent.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `ssh-agent`: Authentication agent.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `ssh-copy-id`: Install your public key in a remote machine's `authorized_keys`.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `ssh-keygen`: Authentication key generation, management and conversion.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `ssh-keyscan`: Gather SSH public keys.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `scp`: Secure copy (remote file copy program).
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `sftp`: Secure file transfer program.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `wget`: Non-interactive network downloader.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `curl`: Transfer data from or to a server.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `rsync`: A fast, versatile, remote (and local) file-copying tool.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `rpcbind`: Universal addresses to program number mapper.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `rpcinfo`: Report RPC information.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `resolvectl`: Resolve domain names, IP addresses, DNS resource records, and network interfaces.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `networkctl`: Control the system network.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `clockdiff`: Measure clock difference between hosts.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] • `named-checkzone`, `named-compilezone`, `named-nzd2nzf`: BIND DNS server utilities.
2025-10-30 09:18:04 [gemini-2.5-05] 
