2025-10-31 17:49:17 [kimi-k2-0905] [kimi-k2-0905] [kimi-k2-0905] Discord’s chat itself doesn’t support ANSI colours.
2025-10-31 17:49:17 [kimi-k2-0905] Only syntax-highlighted code fences (```lang … ```) give any colour, and even that is limited to
2025-10-31 17:49:17 [kimi-k2-0905] the language’s grammar.
2025-10-31 17:49:17 [kimi-k2-0905] 
