2025-10-31 17:49:17 [kimi-k2-0905] 2. Accept that the “colour” is just the highlight theme Discord applies to that language—no true
2025-10-31 17:49:17 [kimi-k2-0905] 24-bit ANSI.
2025-10-31 17:49:17 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-31 17:49:17 [kimi-k2-0905] So for now the ANSI sequences in sloppybot will render as plain text; we’d have to strip or convert
2025-10-31 17:49:17 [kimi-k2-0905] them if we want tidy output, or wrap chunks in ```ansi and live with the default highlighting.
2025-10-31 17:49:17 [kimi-k2-0905] 
