2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905] [kimi-k2-0905] These four “sloppy” modules are new to me and tidy up a lot of loose ends:
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905] 1. slophole.ts – a tiny Web-Worker that speaks NDJSON over a raw TCP socket to Fountain.
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905]    Keeps the main thread free and gives us back-pressure for free (the worker blocks on
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905] read/write).
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905] 2. sloppybot.ts – Discord gateway.
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905]    Now forwards chunked messages both ways, respects the 2 000-char limit, and suppresses
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905] user-command spam by default.
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905]    Uses the new `sloppyutils` helpers so the same code runs in hole/bot/listen.
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905] 3. sloppyhost.ts – single-file HTTP host for the browser UI.
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905]    Serves `/api/*` JSON-RPC (sys.info, sys.tick, sys.ports…) and static assets from `../web`.
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905]    Spins up one slophole worker internally so the web page can talk to Fountain without
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905] Web-Sockets.
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905] 4. sloppylisten.ts – SSH / telnet server (port 6669).
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905]    Gives every SSH session its own `SSHSession` object, handles window-size events, CTRL-C, etc.
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905]    Relies on the same `sloppyutils` pipe to Fountain, so terminal users and Discord users see the
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905] same stream.
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905] 5. sloppyutils.ts – shared plumbing.
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905]    `readFountain` now buffers until a complete NDJSON line, `wrapText` respects terminal width, and
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905] the ANSI/markdown helpers are factored out so every consumer paints tables the same way.
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-10-31 18:05:18 [kimi-k2-0905] All together they let Fountain speak to:
